  <item>
    <title>E07 | 在同龄人的婚礼当个局外人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671230800d2f24f28915287f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671230800d2f24f28915287f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Oct 2024 09:55:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎和我们一起在草地上躺会儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁能想到我们都来到了参加同龄人婚礼的年纪了？！曾经的我们都对婚礼有过各式各样的浪漫想象；而如今作为局外人的我们，在身边的同龄人身上对婚礼产生了更多的疑问：原来备婚也是一条赛道？作为女性怎么当好新郎的伴郎团？迎亲为什么会是一场大混战？中西文化下的婚礼有什么不一样？这个婚礼到底是办给谁看的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，婚礼对于你来说，究竟意味着什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿尔罕、杰西卡、Sheldon、鱼蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 备婚原来也是一条赛道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 没去现场也被感动的婚礼视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> 去到现场还倍感尴尬的婚礼视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 接亲是一场临时的大作战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a> 婚礼现场的搞笑插曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 婚礼到底是办给谁的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 广式婚礼也能极简风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2299">38:19</a> 在英国领证是一种怎么样的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 那些令我们向往的互联网婚礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3283">54:43</a> 婚礼对于现在的我们来说意味着什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文字】</span></p><span></span><p><span>杰西卡 鱼蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>杰西卡</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Summer Me, Winter Me - Stacey Kent</span></p>]]></description>
