    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【关于本期】&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎和我们一起在草地上躺会儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目成立以来，终于有了第一次全员集合的线下录制！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次我们相聚在成都，共同开启了川西之旅：四姑娘山充满高反的壮阔山景，九寨沟秀丽动人的湖光山色，还有不间断的四川美食。最快乐的旅程果然是有朋友们在身边！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿尔罕、杰西卡、Sheldon、鱼蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 美食重在饱腹感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> 转角遇见狼牙土豆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> 人间仙境五花海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> 别致美丽芦苇海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">17:37</a> 原来鱼蛋爱的是高反</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a> 5人3台相机大评比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1614">26:54</a> 差点误入都市怪谈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文字】</span></p><span></span><p><span>杰西卡</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>杰西卡</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Summer Me, Winter Me - Stacey Kent</span></p>]]></description>
