    <title>E05｜Just Say Yes To Sports!</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ac74d133ddcbb53ccdb71e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ac74d133ddcbb53ccdb71e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Aug 2024 05:55:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎和我们一起在草地上躺会儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾几何时，杰西卡的房间里一直挂着一幅海报，海报上的内容也是她的人生信条: Just say no to sports！转眼间，我们怎么都走上了当初那条“未选择的路”？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgQRm8kmvDD3bU7jWuJekv-ffBss.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿尔罕 杰西卡 Sheldon 鱼蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 我们最近尝试的运动和新的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a> 已经到了需要缓解颈椎问题而打羽毛球的年龄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a> 在香港上超高性价比的健身课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a> 抱石攀岩新尝试：首先要学会怎么摔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 鱼蛋有腹肌了！羽毛球、帕梅拉和负重有氧的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 你用什么器械在家锻炼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">21:57</a> 壁球初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1511">25:11</a> 穷人高尔夫平替：室内电子高尔夫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1786">29:46</a> 灵魂提问：你真的喜欢运动吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2192">36:32</a> 我们到底为啥要运动？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文字】</span></p><span></span><p><span>杰西卡 阿尔罕</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>杰西卡</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Summer Me, Winter Me - Stacey Kent</span></p>]]></description>
