  <item>
    <title>E04 | 过春天-春和景明踏青季</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6633b0b403bcdd73a9315272</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6633b0b403bcdd73a9315272</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 May 2024 15:26:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎和我们一起在草地上躺会儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span>告别冬日的沉闷与阴郁，我们终于可以拥抱春天了！在这个春天，我们不约而同地选择了走出去：走到长满羊群的山野里，走到春意盎然的西湖边，走到古灵精怪的狐獴之间，走到激情四射的田径场上……感谢春天，让我们在灿烂春光里重新注入勃勃生机。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是怎么过春天的呢？欢迎在评论区和我们分享春天带给你的独特体验🍃</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后送给大家一句林清玄写给春天的话：</span></p><span></span><p><span>跨过去，春天不远了，我永远不要失去发芽的心情。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvCc36qY6urUvrrbzjaQOngnsWjn.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>青绿山野上点缀着小羊 | Totnes</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgQcHpKQln5KJPLhtHZA0EMfqXvO.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>漓江上的小竹筏 | 桂林</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnKuO7s7TeM1l_8sKi_rBHGjkOUo.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>如绸缎般的西湖湖面 | 杭州</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foo8Qr2Kfbhgng0wgAp-FL4WRzHU.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在狐獴群中看狐獴 | 南京</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnPdmZy6Nux6wGIC8tNquSG-fnWv.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>赛场上新的世界纪录 | 厦门</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿尔罕、杰西卡、Sheldon、鱼蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> 杰西卡的英国春日乡村之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="724">12:04</a> 阿尔罕好坏参半的桂林游分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> Sheldon和阿尔罕的杭州会晤：在西湖撞见春意盎然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a> Sheldon的南京红山动物园一日游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3051">50:51</a> 鱼蛋的厦门行：找搭子、看田径赛、吃福建美食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3717">61:57</a> 主播们的春季活动项目推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文字】</span></p><span></span><p><span>杰西卡、阿尔罕</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>鱼蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Summer Me, Winter Me - Stacey Kent</span></p>]]></description>
